  "prompt": "LedgerLoop's product team is checking app events on the day the clocks went back. For each app event on 26 October 2025 (the UTC day of event_ts, a UTC instant), show how many seconds passed since the same user's previous event that day. Use only that day's events, so a user's first event of the day shows gap_seconds as missing. Measure the time between the two moments, not between clock times. Return four columns, in this order: event_id, user_id, event_ts and gap_seconds. Return one row for each event. Any row order is fine.",
